{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/tilal-binghatti-oasis-villas-academic-city","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1464,"crm_id":"7666","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Tilal Binghatti Oasis Villas","slug":"tilal-binghatti-oasis-villas-academic-city","display_address":"Academic City","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Binghatti","price":4200000,"display_price":"4.2M","lattitude":25.122301779414,"longitude":55.433941788879,"min_bedrooms":4,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>The Oasis Villas places buyers at the heart of Tilal Binghatti. Sitting at the center of the masterplan, the cluster connects directly to the beachfront, clubhouse, and central parks, making it the most socially connected pocket of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-binghatti/\">Binghatti's</a> first-ever villa community.</p><p>Built around a vibrant, family-oriented atmosphere, the Oasis Villas suit buyers who want to have an active lifestyle. Children's play areas, open green spaces, and walkable leisure destinations are all within reach, while the wider community brings together retail, dining, wellness, and schools under one community.</p><p>Each villa offers four bedrooms, double-height living areas, an in-unit elevator, a driver's and maid's room, and a private resort-scale pool. Interiors carry a layered palette of marble, light oak, travertine, and metal detailing, finished to mansion-grade standards.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_bdf505d06a.jpg","hash":"Feature_bdf505d06a","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_29bcded60a.jpg","hash":"Banner_29bcded60a","name":"Banner.jpg"},"med